### 1. Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### 2. Create a new order (Success case)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Abdi",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 15000,
  "telebirrPhone": "0911223344"
}

### 3. Test validation error (totalSantim is negative -> returns 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Abdi",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": -5
}